  "scope": "Two disposable single-member etcd v3.6.8 processes, each in Docker network mode none. The manual case uses three public synthetic marker keys and one bounded deleted padding key, observes an old exact-key read before compaction, compacts the current revision, verifies that only the old read is rejected, and measures reclaimed database bytes after one online defrag. A second process checks periodic auto-compaction with a real 8-second retention window. No Kubernetes API or production data is used. Multi-member sequencing, real workload availability, sizing, and production retention selection are outside scope.",
